---
import { EMAIL } from '../../lib/data';
---

<a href="https://wa.me/5491155555555" class="cta-mobile-bar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
  <span>Pedir presupuesto</span>
  <span>WhatsApp →</span>
</a>

<section class="cta-banner">
  <div class="cta-content">
    <h2 class="cta-title">Armá tu lista y te pasamos el presupuesto hoy.</h2>
    <p class="cta-body">Cargás los productos en el catálogo, nos llega por WhatsApp y te respondemos con precios y disponibilidad.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cta-actions">
    <a href="https://wa.me/5491155555555" class="btn-green" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      WhatsApp
    </a>
    <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`} class="btn-outline-dark">{EMAIL}</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-mobile-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    background: var(--color-green);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    text-decoration: none;

    &:hover {
      background: var(--color-green-hover);
      color: #fff;
    }
  }

  .cta-banner {
    display: none;
  }

  .cta-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: 33px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .cta-body {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #A8AFB5;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .btn-green {
    padding: 16px 28px;
    background: var(--color-green);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    text-decoration: none;

    &:hover {
      background: var(--color-green-hover);
      color: #fff;
    }
  }

  .btn-outline-dark {
    padding: 16px 28px;
    border: 1.5px solid #5A6068;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    text-decoration: none;
    word-break: break-all;

    &:hover {
      border-color: #A8AFB5;
      color: #fff;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 769px) {
    .cta-mobile-bar {
      display: none;
    }

    .cta-banner {
      display: flex;
      padding: 64px 40px;
      background: var(--color-charcoal);
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }
</style>
